  "pages": [
    {
      "page_id": "p01",
      "text": "Yuna threw a ball down the hall. Gran's blue jug fell and broke.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p01.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p01.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 5668,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p01.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7157
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "A few blue bits lay on the new rug. Nobody saw.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p02.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p02.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 4388,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p02.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 5302
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p03",
      "text": "Yuna got a tube of new blue glue. \"I can fix it!\"",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p03.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p03.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 4728,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p03.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 5955
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "She glued a few bits on. Then a few more. The blue glue ran down her arm.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6190,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7915
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "Then the new glue stuck her hand to the blue jug. Yuna tugged and tugged.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6034,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7026
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Her dog had a chew on the tube. Now his chin was blue with glue!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 5929,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6791
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "The jug stood up crooked, with glue drips and a few bits missing. Not true blue \u2014 glue blue.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8724,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8986
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "A blue dog chin is a big clue! Yuna got a pen to write the true thing.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6190,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8045
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "Yuna's note said: \"It is true. I threw a ball. I broke your blue jug. I glued it. The dog had a chew.\"",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 9769,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 11964
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p10",
      "text": "\"It is true,\" Gran said. \"I never did like that blue jug!\" The glued jug went in the bin. The note went up on the fridge.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_075/pages/p10.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_075/audio/pages/p10.mp3",
